        <div type="layout" source="#source-144396-144814" style="padding-inline-start: 2em; text-indent: -1em">
          <p>注意　この切図と各部の名称価格等は『食道楽』夏の巻付録に委しければ読者<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-144566-144584"><rb>就</rb><rt>つい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-144584-144587">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-144587-144599"><rb>覧</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-144599-144611">らるべし</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-144659-144773"><lem><seg source="#source-144611-144659">〔夏の巻付録「西洋食品価格表」〕</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-144737-144767">〔上巻五六九ページ〕</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-144773-144778">。</seg></p>
